# The generated registry index and manifests are compared byte-for-byte by
# `sillview-widgets index --check`, which always emits LF. Pin text files to LF so a
# Windows checkout (core.autocrlf) can't turn the committed bytes into CRLF and fail
# the gate locally.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
